<!doctype lake><title>🐘 𝓐𝓵𝓲𝓰𝓷𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="iaFhR" id="iaFhR" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8195e6d6" id="u8195e6d6"> </span><span data-lake-id="u3a610c7e" id="u3a610c7e">🍃</span><span data-lake-id="u9d26d594" id="u9d26d594"> 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐏𝐎: 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐚 𝐑𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞-𝐅𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐑𝐞𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐝</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u5c29fbdd" id="u5c29fbdd"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub226330d" id="ub226330d">基于人类反馈的强化学习是一种广泛采用的语言模型微调方法，旨在实现有效的模型对齐。尽管经典的 RLHF 方法已取得显著成效，但其多阶段训练流程也带来优化上的挑战：首先需要训练奖励模型，随后再优化策略模型，以最大化该奖励</span></strong></p><ul list="udcee849d"><li fid="u0bd15575" data-lake-id="u18b95d63" id="u18b95d63"><span data-lake-id="u387d8474" id="u387d8474">研究者开始探索更为简洁的离线算法，直接偏好优化便是其中之一。DPO 对 RLHF 中的奖励函数进行重参数化，直接利用偏好数据学习策略模型，从而无需显式的奖励模型</span></li><li fid="u0bd15575" data-lake-id="u7aa5b987" id="u7aa5b987"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e0ef9f3" id="u9e0ef9f3" style="color: #5C0036">在 DPO 中，隐式奖励通过同一回答在当前策略模型与监督微调模型下的似然比的对数来构造。然而，这种奖励形式并未与用于指导生成过程的指标直接保持一致；后者可近似表示为策略模型生成回答的平均对数似然。作者推测，这种训练与推理之间的不一致可能导致次优性能</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf43538b9" id="uf43538b9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub72f85ee" id="ub72f85ee" style="color: #AD1A2B">本文提出 SimPO，一种简单而有效的离线偏好优化算法。该算法的核心在于，使偏好优化目标中的奖励函数与生成阶段所使用的指标保持一致</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucee504c6" id="ucee504c6">。SimPO 包含两个主要组成部分：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4f03c5e" id="uf4f03c5e" style="color: #663000">长度归一化奖励，即利用策略模型计算回答中所有 token 的平均对数概率</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ueccef137" id="ueccef137">；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5d6dc92" id="ub5d6dc92" style="color: #270070">目标奖励间隔，用于确保偏好回答与非偏好回答之间的奖励差值超过该间隔</span></strong></p><ul list="u924ea00d"><li fid="ucef1f327" data-lake-id="ub8754d7d" id="ub8754d7d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u93eb7de5" id="u93eb7de5">简洁性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0436b19c" id="u0436b19c">SimPO 无需参考模型，因此相较于 DPO 及其他依赖参考模型的方法，其更加轻量，也更易于实现。</span></li><li fid="ucef1f327" data-lake-id="ub2a90b63" id="ub2a90b63"><strong><span data-lake-id="u659d15c4" id="u659d15c4">较少利用长度偏置：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2fe7618c" id="u2fe7618c">与 SFT 或 DPO 模型相比，SimPO 并未显著增加回答长度，表明其较少通过利用长度偏置获得性能提升</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6c7f6cca" id="u6c7f6cca" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1755431972568-baeb92a4-c2b0-454f-bbc9-31a548bf512a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u397ab043-23df-46ce-a797-821dcdb407b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubef56b15-50a0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A899%2C%22height%22%3A196%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A75961%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1641%2C%22originHeight%22%3A357%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PACAEVAL2LCWINRATE(%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A265%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A-HARDWINRATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1327%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A185%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LDPO(TTE%3BTREF%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A206%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIMPOTTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRALMIST%22%2C%22x%22%3A775%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GO81LOG%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A95%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220GT0(G3%22%2C%22x%22%3A206%2C%22y%22%3A267%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EF(GWR%22%2C%22x%22%3A231%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASE7BILNSTRUCT7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A749%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A176%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DP%22%2C%22x%22%3A1185%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REF(GL3%22%2C%22x%22%3A445%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E(G3%22%2C%22x%22%3A226%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220(G1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A447%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B7%A5SIMPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A734%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNSTRUCTBB%22%2C%22x%22%3A1516%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ASE7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1237%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASE8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A944%2C%22y%22%3A311%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNSTRUCT8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A1024%2C%22y%22%3A311%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIMP0%22%2C%22x%22%3A1217%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INSTRUCT7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1311%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DP0%22%2C%22x%22%3A734%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A942%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B3.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A973%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISTRAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1236%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1393%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1517%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1037%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGO%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISTRAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1321%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B5.3%22%2C%22x%22%3A854%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B4.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1060%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210G0(G)%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A421%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B1.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A1556%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B1OG%22%2C%22x%22%3A369%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A183%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B7.5%22%2C%22x%22%3A1454%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASE8BL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1433%2C%22y%22%3A310%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ebe9ed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uae4b61e4%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="lRS3j" id="lRS3j" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0eccfd6c" id="u0eccfd6c">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u3fde1afd" id="u3fde1afd"> 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐏𝐎: 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u480cca3e" id="u480cca3e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd8f2b02" id="ufd8f2b02">DPO 是最广泛使用的偏好优化方法之一。DPO 无需学习显式的奖励模型，而是利用包含最优策略的闭式表达式，对奖励函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wYkM0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u98ceb55d" id="u98ceb55d">进行重参数化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf9f21af4" id="uf9f21af4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%2B%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Clog%20Z(x).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F49a6f412a891f18f8293593ff0d45eab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TL2Mu%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2f360020"><li fid="ua599fa7a" data-lake-id="u1d566a84" id="u1d566a84"><span data-lake-id="u212407ac" id="u212407ac">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ciqfo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f606f20" id="u5f606f20">为策略模型，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff73154893f2557c1227ee196e79412a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jQphK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9faaa47a" id="u9faaa47a">为参考策略，通常采用监督微调模型，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1e77bac46833188a4177545f386f8565.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j7qDc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued5a7948" id="ued5a7948">为配分函数。将这一奖励形式代入 Bradley–Terry（BT）排序目标，即 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(y_w%5C%5Csucc%20y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Csigma(r(x%2Cy_w)-r(x%2Cy_l))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd086faf220ad1c257e8ca901451d06b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x43cL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f89736b" id="u9f89736b">，DPO 便可通过策略模型而非奖励模型来表示偏好数据的概率，从而得到以下优化目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5a59b0f0" id="u5a59b0f0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%3D-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D-%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67dd5b05039d6642f69f1d00ca42925a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GWQXF%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8f8fcf9f"><li fid="u912b5575" data-lake-id="ueb768463" id="ueb768463"><span data-lake-id="u632bfdc7" id="u632bfdc7">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fac14c2d9bdedbcd69cf8d8827a1cf21d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MJq40%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf348f1a1" id="uf348f1a1">表示偏好数据集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5903f53f4f8c62f99df77e4e3ccbc4e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AAeZv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4817c33a" id="u4817c33a">中的成对偏好样本，由提示、偏好回答和非偏好回答构成</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3f3498c8" id="u3f3498c8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b4a26ad" id="u2b4a26ad" style="color: #AD1A2B">隐式奖励存在以下不足：训练过程中需要参考模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff73154893f2557c1227ee196e79412a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZrX8q%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7bb70e1c" id="u7bb70e1c" style="color: #AD1A2B">，从而引入额外的内存开销和计算成本；训练阶段所优化的奖励与推理阶段所优化的对数似然并不一致，而推理阶段并不涉及参考模型</span></strong></p><ul list="u8a553f54"><li fid="u4e624f84" data-lake-id="uaa93117d" id="uaa93117d"><span data-lake-id="ubf881c09" id="ubf881c09">在 DPO 中，对于任意三元组</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fac14c2d9bdedbcd69cf8d8827a1cf21d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wRQ4c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0abd3635" id="u0abd3635">，满足奖励排序</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%2Cy_w)%3Er(x%2Cy_l)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F095c36308fd232421894b0514129127b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oRCKB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a922459" id="u9a922459">，并不必然意味着满足似然排序</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3Ep_%5C%5Ctheta(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F20733804c4d58151549a92273f3f618f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D9gqm%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub966874a" id="ub966874a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u581f669f" id="u581f669f">长度归一化的奖励形式：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua81ad4f5" id="ua81ad4f5">一种解决方案是将所有 token 的对数概率之和作为奖励，但这种方式存在长度偏置</span></p><ul list="uaf10419e"><li fid="u3b7601a9" data-lake-id="uf7370447" id="uf7370447"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub03172ea" id="ub03172ea" style="color: #5C0036">较长的序列往往具有更低的对数概率。当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d3748a1a6b1a91dda986e0b204471a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pH8xV%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb7e7831" id="ucb7e7831" style="color: #5C0036">比</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5940c70497dd7c00369aa6f50b3cc63b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IfY2C%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe0fdb05" id="ufe0fdb05" style="color: #5C0036">更长时，将对数概率之和作为奖励进行优化，会迫使模型人为抬高较长序列的概率，以确保</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d3748a1a6b1a91dda986e0b204471a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s8V6e%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua263f120" id="ua263f120" style="color: #5C0036">获得高于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5940c70497dd7c00369aa6f50b3cc63b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ceCEP%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3175a210" id="u3175a210" style="color: #5C0036">的奖励。这种过度补偿会增加生成退化的风险。为解决这一问题，考虑将平均对数似然作为隐式奖励</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3369866f" id="u3369866f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7B%3Ci%7D).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e0a06c278bc380dee5a07649493cc77.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wBweD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u6e77ced0"><li fid="uaaddcf62" data-lake-id="u6840ad8e" id="u6840ad8e"><span data-lake-id="u8b23a0be" id="u8b23a0be">这一指标通常用于对束搜索中的候选序列以及语言模型多项选择任务中的候选选项进行排序。考虑使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3f197b904ccc8bce421a3124813852.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22an5Rb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e3c537b" id="u2e3c537b">替代 DPO 的奖励形式，使其与指导生成过程的似然指标保持一致，由此得到经过长度归一化的奖励</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4089786b" id="u4089786b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSimPO%7D%7D(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7B%3Ci%7D).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8822208ff18496ce3f25ac957aaf273d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kceg6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud29c7fb1"><li fid="u04e71b18" data-lake-id="u0b93999c" id="u0b93999c"><span data-lake-id="u6b7a23c7" id="u6b7a23c7">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yc7VQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f57e0f1" id="u6f57e0f1">是控制奖励差值缩放幅度的常数。按照回答长度对奖励进行归一化至关重要：从奖励形式中移除长度归一化项，会导致模型倾向于生成更长但质量更低的序列。这一奖励形式无需参考模型，因此相较于依赖参考模型的算法，具有更高的内存使用效率和计算效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud19739de" id="ud19739de" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790748864637-0196fceb-9409-41a7-8156-d5d518c06cd2.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucc8e7a06-8477-402d-8ef9-d557466a0c4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9ca50be6-43ae-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A643.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A342%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A271382%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1147%2C%22originHeight%22%3A610%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGA(BLOGE(YWR)-BLOGTO(9W)-%E5%85%A5LOGTE(G2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A189%2C%22y%22%3A278%2C%22width%22%3A548%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%A50(810GEU-ZER%E5%8D%81%E5%85%A510(ZRE-810GE%22%2C%22x%22%3A179%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A511%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHEREZRER%3DE(AN)~D%5BBKL(TE(G2)TREF(GW))%22%2C%22x%22%3A172%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A470%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHEREPE(R)%3DEXP(%E7%82%B9LOG%E5%85%83E(GA)%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A369%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGPE(GR)-%E5%85%A5ALOGOLOG2%E7%A4%BA%22%2C%22x%22%3A181%2C%22y%22%3A402%2C%22width%22%3A392%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YE%5B0.30.5%2C1.01.2%2C1.41.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A835%2C%22y%22%3A578%2C%22width%22%3A299%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%A5%3D1.0%2C3E%5B0.01%2C0.05%2C0.1%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A837%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A295%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%A5E%5B0.1%2C0.5%2C1.0%2C10.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A834%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A222%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%A5E%5B0.1%2C0.5%2C1.0%2C10.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A819%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A243%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAX(0%2C0-1OGTE(GOW)%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A254%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOG0%E4%B8%80LOGTE(GWW)-%22%2C%22x%22%3A182%2C%22y%22%3A566%2C%22width%22%3A297%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BE0.01%2C0.05%2C0.1%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A834%2C%22y%22%3A358%2C%22width%22%3A197%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGEU-LOGUU%22%2C%22x%22%3A184%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A266%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228E%5B0.01%2C0.05%2C0.1%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A828%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A208%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AE%5B0.10.5%2C1.02.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A835%2C%22y%22%3A417%2C%22width%22%3A216%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227E%5B0.01%2C0.1%2C0.5%2C1.0%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A834%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A235%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223)%E5%8D%8110G%E5%85%830(9))%22%2C%22x%22%3A377%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A202%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210G0810G%22%2C%22x%22%3A192%2C%22y%22%3A176%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%8010GT0(93%22%2C%22x%22%3A419%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A200%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGTE(GW)%E5%8D%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A301%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SLIC-HF96%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)-%E5%85%A5LOGTE(YWX)%22%2C%22x%22%3A555%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A183%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228E0.01%2C0.05%2C0.1%22%2C%22x%22%3A836%2C%22y%22%3A515%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210G%E9%87%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A432%2C%22y%22%3A177%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BRER(GAU)BTREF(YL)%22%2C%22x%22%3A195%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A266%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORPO%5B42%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A416%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALOGTE(GR%E5%85%A5E%22%2C%22x%22%3A662%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A221%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R-DPO%5B64%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A503%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228E%5B0.1%2C0.5%2C1.0%2C2.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A828%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A227%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QE%5B0.05.0.1.0.5.1.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A837%2C%22y%22%3A491%2C%22width%22%3A216%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B1OGAUU%22%2C%22x%22%3A232%2C%22y%22%3A502%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HYPERPARAMETER%22%2C%22x%22%3A840%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KTO%5B29%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A335%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228E%5B2.0%2C2.5%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A835%2C%22y%22%3A553%2C%22width%22%3A228%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WLTETPABTRER(G)%22%2C%22x%22%3A494%2C%22y%22%3A338%2C%22width%22%3A242%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DPO%5BOO%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A8%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%A5%3D%E5%85%A5W%3D1.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A833%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIMPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A568%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%83REF(YAUSR%22%2C%22x%22%3A303%2C%22y%22%3A519%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBJECTIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A172%2C%22y%22%3A10%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RRHF%5B91%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAX(0%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A169%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IPO%5B6%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CPO%5B88%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%E4%B8%80PE(912)%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A419%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221OOE92%22%2C%22x%22%3A435%2C%22y%22%3A503%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REF(GL)%22%2C%22x%22%3A483%2C%22y%22%3A521%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22METHO%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WPSMRER(YAUA)ETE%22%2C%22x%22%3A177%2C%22y%22%3A337%2C%22width%22%3A292%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221OGTE(3-%22%2C%22x%22%3A484%2C%22y%22%3A570%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225B1-P8(YU0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A350%2C%22y%22%3A419%2C%22width%22%3A238%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PE(G%E4%BC%81)%22%2C%22x%22%3A627%2C%22y%22%3A402%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225RE(GU)%22%2C%22x%22%3A265%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%801OG0%22%2C%22x%22%3A171%2C%22y%22%3A506%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E5%8D%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A446%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(AY%22%2C%22x%22%3A587%2C%22y%22%3A508%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QG9)%22%2C%22x%22%3A679%2C%22y%22%3A506%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210G%22%2C%22x%22%3A458%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221T%22%2C%22x%22%3A267%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eeeeee%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uecd2cdb1%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u11a07c09" id="u11a07c09"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d26db4b" id="u3d26db4b">目标奖励间隔：在 Bradley–Terry 目标中引入目标奖励间隔项</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8feaa5628f7ccd6f410a7a1bf16ce038.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3lAn%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2fee2151" id="u2fee2151">，以确保偏好回答的奖励</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%2Cy_w)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d3fb8e941efc857415f81c9dfc40fa5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l1WZI%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uad7697d6" id="uad7697d6">至少比非偏好回答的奖励</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%2Cy_l)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff4ac8ff4e4aa2da6b44ea0fce8b6804d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lWue6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u77dfb5cf" id="u77dfb5cf">高出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w1gV6%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua3cbb41e" id="ua3cbb41e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(y_w%5C%5Csucc%20y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(r(x%2Cy_w)-r(x%2Cy_l)-%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffe5a7b57e836f48cebc202f0f5cd18cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m1aAb%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc79c9124"><li fid="u2fa7fd4b" data-lake-id="u58c700ae" id="u58c700ae"><span data-lake-id="ub84c5022" id="ub84c5022">两个类别之间的间隔会影响分类器的泛化能力。在采用随机模型初始化的标准训练设置中，增大目标间隔通常能够改善泛化性能</span></li><li fid="u2fa7fd4b" data-lake-id="u98934017" id="u98934017"><span data-lake-id="u9ac804a4" id="u9ac804a4">在偏好优化中，这两个类别分别对应同一输入下的偏好回答和非偏好回答。随着目标间隔增大，生成质量最初会有所提升，但当间隔过大时，生成质量反而会下降</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3f3c1f22" id="u3f3c1f22"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucf322879" id="ucf322879">SimPO 采用一种与生成指标直接保持一致的隐式奖励形式，从而无需参考模型。此外，SimPO 还引入目标奖励间隔，以帮助区分偏好回答与非偏好回答</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u52177d1b" id="u52177d1b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSimPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta)%3D-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%7B%7Cy_w%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%7B%7Cy_l%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)-%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F743db728c880a215fa50c482e8837b84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VdLg9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u727e1e17" id="u727e1e17" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1755432972764-1f2978f5-9e2a-4c19-afaf-961266d9701b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua0a0f430-8f66-470a-8223-081714d6755%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4236845b-cb6b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A816.7272727272727%2C%22height%22%3A488%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A121930%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1123%2C%22originHeight%22%3A671%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22REJECTED_REWARDS%3DSELF.BETA*POLICY_REJECTED_LOGPS.DETACH()%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A582%2C%22width%22%3A781%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHOSEN_REWARDS%3DSELF.BETA*POLICY_CHOSEN_LOGPS.DETACH()%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A546%2C%22width%22%3A734%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-%3ETUPLE%5BTORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATTENSOR%5D%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A861%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.LOGSIGMOID(-SELF.BETA*LOGITS)*SELF.LABEL_SMOOTHING%22%2C%22x%22%3A140%2C%22y%22%3A441%2C%22width%22%3A715%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURNLOSSES%2CCHOSEN_REWARDS%2CREJECTED_NEWARDS%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A619%2C%22width%22%3A609%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-F.LOGSIGMOID(SELF%2CBETA*LOGITS)*(1-SELF.LABEL_SMOOTHING)%22%2C%22x%22%3A103%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A798%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PI_LOGRATIOS%3DPOLICY_CHOSEN_LOGPS-POLICY_REJECTED_LOGPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A743%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLICY_REJECTED_LOGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A528%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGITS%3DPI_LOGRATIOS-SELF.GAMMA_BETA_RATIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A584%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%23CORESIMP0%3ALOGPROBABILITYDIFFERENCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A532%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLICY_CHOSEN_LOGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSON%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A88%2C%22width%22%3A499%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%23SIQMOIDLOSS(MAINVARIANT%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A377%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EFSIMPO_LOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A180%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SEF%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOSSESE%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A369%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEF%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfbf9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub58d323a%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u35e1a788" id="u35e1a788"><br></p>